*** Test Cases ***
### SA

[1]CB007491_G_template_test
    [Documentation]
    ...     Conditions:     it is based on the configuration ${C_Cell}
    ...     Actions:        to complete...
    ...
    ...     Checks:
    ...     Verdict:        calls for multi ues and PRB pooling are passed
    [Tags]  CLOUD_5G_I_LO_AP_LO     VARIANT_SANSA_FS_CPRI_CMWV_FDD+ECPRI_CMWV_TDD_AEQE   CB007491-G
    Set To Dictionary       ${C_Cell}    totalNbOfUe       4
    Set test Variable       ${LuaFileToUsed_path}          ${LuaFileToUsed_path_ABIO}
    TC CB007491 4 Cells   ${C_Cell}    ${dictParam}    ${Vendor_IWK_CB8940-L_CB7113}    ${dict_settings_all_ues}    nrCell=4
    ...       Kw TestLine Preparation=TL_Preparation_CB007491_2Cells_CFG1_8DL_8UL
    ...       kw Set RAD Params=Set RAD Params Of 7491 ASOE
    ...       kw NIDD Set=Set CB007491 NIDD PARAMETERS with ulMUMIMO
    ...       kw NIDD Check=Check CB007491 NIDD PARAMETERS with ulMUMIMO
